OL,3,GNEWSAWatchdog raises concerns over QMC
OL,4,Acorridor care
OL,5,
OL,6,FUrgent and emergency care at Queen's
OL,7,FMedical Centre (QMC) in Nottingham
OL,8,Fstill requires improvement, according
OL,9,Fto the Care Quality Commission (CQC).
OL,11,FAn unannounced inspection by the
OL,12,Fwatchdog in April found A&E was often
OL,13,Fcaring for more patients than it was
OL,14,Fdesigned for, with people treated in
OL,15,Fcorridors due to a lack of space.
OL,17,FQMC, which is run by Nottingham
OL,18,FUniversity Hospitals NHS Trust (NUH),
OL,19,Fretained its overall rating of requires
OL,20,Fimprovement, while Nottingham City
OL,21,FHospital, also run by NUH, remained
OL,22,Frated as good.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
